ID: vr-37
Title: Opt-in warm CLI speech for selected agent sessions

Status: DONE
GitHub issue: https://github.com/Zanark/Verona/issues/36
Milestone: An explicit local agent session can speak through Verona without restarting its engines per reply.
Dependencies: vr-13, vr-35

Purpose:
The owner wants selected future Agency/Copilot sessions to use Verona to speak
their replies. Performance is the priority. Provide explicit CLI calls, not
automatic narration, transcript scraping or global agent hooks.

Tasks:
[x] Add a lightweight stdin/JSON CLI and an explicitly started named host.
[x] Keep the model, native renderer and local Windows synthesizer warm.
[x] Use bounded latest-only jobs, no queue, no overlap or automatic replay.
[x] Support spoken animated faces and an explicit faster voice-only option.
[x] Report actual playback completion, errors, cancellation and staleness.
[x] Keep capabilities private and ephemeral; do not save reply text or audio.
[x] Exercise isolated synthetic/muted native playback and measure latency.
[x] Update guide/book/brief/index/causal ledger, tracking and owned continuity.
[x] Prepare verified Zanark source delivery; no release or deployment.

Acceptance criteria:
Normal browser/desktop behavior stays opt-out and unchanged.
Only explicitly selected sessions call the named host. No hook/config/scheduler
is installed and no existing app is discovered, attached, restarted or stopped.
CLI clients use only the standard library and do not load NumPy/ONNX/Electron.
Warm calls reuse one TTS worker, one model and one renderer; idle work is bounded.
Speech remains 1-280 characters/25 seconds. Concurrent requests fail explicitly.
Success means the renderer reports ended, not merely accepted or generated.
Disconnects, replaced IDs, timeouts and stale hosts must not look successful.
Cancellation stops playback and cancels inference at the next bounded checkpoint;
document the Windows synthesis boundary. No automatic replay after reconnection.
Capability files are current-user protected, excluded from source and removed
on clean shutdown; stale files require explicit cleanup, not silent replacement.
Tests never play audible speech or drive user/sibling apps/profiles/devices.
Use separate hidden native host/profile, RAM, synthesis and derived-cache lane.
Record cold/warm/repeat/voice-only measurements with their exact scope, not
an invented universal real-time guarantee or listening/accuracy acceptance.

