Completion log:
2026-11-20 - Owner requests a CLI-accessible speaking option for selected future
agent sessions and explicitly prioritizes performance. Design uses a dedicated
opt-in warm host, capability-authenticated loopback calls and native push IPC;
no idle renderer polling or automatic agent-session activation.
